'''Midnight''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by [[Crafting|crafting]] it or through trading. 

==Appearance==
The whole knife is primarily midnight blue, only excluding the guard, which is silver in color. Its blade has a few patches on it that are a lighter shade of blue, resembling the night sky during midnight, hence the name. 

==Trivia ==
*Players can exchange 12 rare [[shards]] through [[crafting]] to obtain this by chance.
